hadiths[22]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1806","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nabiyon mein koi Nabi nahi magar use diya gaya jo us jaisa bashar us par imaan laaey. Aur beshak jo mujhey diya gaya wahi hai jo Allah ne meri taraf wahi ki. To mujhey ummeed hai ke main Qiyaamat key din un mein sab se zyada pairwikaar wala hunga. (Bukhari: 4981)"
"1807","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Allah Taala ne apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wafaat se pehley wahi lagataar rakhi yahan tak ke Aap ko faut kya, jab wahi sab se zyada thi. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uskey baad faut huey. (Bukhari: 4982). Bara se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab naazil hui: (Mominon mein baithney waley aur Allah key raastey mein jihaad karney waley baraabar nahi hain). To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Merey liye Zaid ko bulaao aur use takhti aur dawaat aur kandhey ki haddi ley kar aana chaahiye. Phir farmaya: Likho: (Baithney waley baraabar nahi hain). Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki peeth key peechey andhay Amr bin Umm Maktoom they. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! To tum mujhey kya hukm detey ho, beshak main andhi aankh wala aadmi hun? To uski jagah naazil hui: (Mominon mein baithney waley aur Allah key raastey mein jihaad karney waley baraabar nahi hain, takleef walon key siwa). (4990). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1808","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Hishaam bin Hakeem bin Hizaam ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi mein Surat-ul-Furqaan padhtey huey suna. To main ne uski qiraat suni aur wo bahut huroof par padhta tha jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey nahi padhaaein they. To main qareeb tha ke namaz mein us se ulajh jaaun. To main thehra yahan tak ke us ne salaam kya. To main ne use uski chaadar se pakad liya aur main ne kaha: Tumhey ye surat kis ne padhaai jo main ne tumhey padhtey huey suni? Us ne kaha: Mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne padhaai. To main ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot kaha! Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey uskey siwa padhaai hai jo tum ne padhi. To main use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf kheench kar ley gaya. To main ne kaha: Beshak main ne isey Surat-ul-Furqaan un huroof par padhtey huey suna hai jo tum ne mujhey nahi padhaaen. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use chhoro! Padho ae Hishaam! To us ne Aap par wo qiraat padhi jo main ne use padhtey huey suni thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aise hi naazil hui hai. Phir farmaya: Padho ae Umar! To main ne wo qiraat padhi jo Aap ne mujhey padhaai thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aise hi naazil hui hai. Beshak ye Quran saat huroof par naazil hua hai. To padho jo us mein se aasaan ho. (Bukhari: 4992)"
"1809","[AI-translation] Faatima (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se sargoshi ki ke Jibreel mujh se har saal Quran ka daur kartey they. Aur beshak unhon-ne is saal mujh se do martaba daur kya hai. Aur main nahi samajhti magar meri maut haazir hui hai. (Bukhari: 3623)"
"1810","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key munh se sattar se zyada suratein leen. (Bukhari: 5000)"
"1811","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Masood Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke wo Hims mein they. To unhon-ne Surat Yusuf padhi. To aadmi ne kaha: Aise naazil nahi hui. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par padhi. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne achha kya. Aur us mein sharaab ki boo paai. To unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum jama kartey ho ke Allah ki Kitaab ko jhutlaao aur sharaab piyo? To us par hadd maari. (Bukhari: 5001)"
"1812","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aadmi ne aadmi ko (Kaho: Wo Allah Aik hai) dohraatey huey suna. Phir jab subah hui to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko uska zikr kya. Jabke aadmi use kam samajhta tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak wo Quran key tihaai key baraabar hai. (Bukhari: 5014)"
"1813","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Saeed Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaaba se farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi aajiz hai ke raat mein Quran ka tihaai padhey? To wo un par giraan guzra aur unhon-ne kaha: Ham mein kaun uski taaqat rakhta hai Ya Rasulullah! To Aap ne farmaya: Allah Aik Be-niyaaz Quran ka tihaai hai. (Bukhari: 5015)"
"1814","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab har raat apne bistar mein aatey to apni donon hatheliyaan jama kartey, phir un mein phoonktey. To un mein padhtey: (Kaho: Wo Allah Aik hai) aur (Kaho: Main subah key Rab ki panaah maangta hun) aur (Kaho: Main logon key Rab ki panaah maangta hun). Phir un se apne jism mein se jitna ho sakta ponchhtey. Un se apne sar aur apne chehrey aur apne jism key saamney par shuru kartey. Wo teen martaba kartey. (Bukhari: 5017)"
"1815","[AI-translation] Usaid bin Huzair (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke wo raat ko Surat-ul-Baqarah padh rahey they jabke uska ghoda uskey paas bandha tha to ghoda ghoomney laga. To wo khaamosh huey aur wo khaamosh hua. To unhon-ne padha aur ghoda ghoomney laga. To wo khaamosh huey aur ghoda khaamosh hua. Phir unhon-ne padha aur ghoda ghoomney laga. To wo wapas aey. Jabke uska beta Yahya uskey qareeb tha aur dara ke use lagey. Phir jab use kheench liya to us ne apna sar aasmaan ki taraf uthaaya yahan tak ke use na dekhta. Phir jab subah hui to us ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bayan kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Padho ae Ibn Huzair! Padho ae Ibn Huzair! Unhon-ne kaha: To main dara Ya Rasulullah ke wo Yahya ko raund dey jabke wo uskey qareeb tha. To main ne apna sar uthaaya aur uski taraf wapas aaya. To main ne apna sar aasmaan ki taraf uthaaya. Phir saaybaan jaisa tha jismein chiraaghon jaisey they. To main nikla yahan tak ke use na dekhta. Aap ne farmaya: Aur tum jaantey ho wo kya tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Wo farishtey they jo tumhaari aawaaz key qareeb aey. Aur agar tum padhtey to subah hoti jabke log unhey dekhtey aur wo un se na chhuptey. (Bukhari: 5018). Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo kehtey they: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne kisi cheez ko ijazat nahi di jo us ne Nabi ko ijazat di ke wo Quran se khush aawaazi karey. (5023). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Allah ne kisi cheez ko ijazat nahi di, waghera. (5024). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1816","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hasad sirf do mein hai: Aadmi jise Allah ne Quran sikhaaya aur wo use raat key auqaat aur din key auqaat mein tilaawat karta hai. To uskey padosi ne use suna aur us ne kaha: Kaash mujhey waisa diya jaata jaisa fulaan ko diya gaya hai aur main waisa karta jaisa wo karta hai. Aur aadmi jise Allah ne maal diya aur wo use haq mein kharch karta hai. To aadmi ne kaha: Kaash mujhey waisa diya jaata jaisa fulaan ko diya gaya hai aur main waisa karta jaisa wo karta hai. (Bukhari: 5026)"
"1817","[AI-translation] Usmaan bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo hai jo Quran seekhey aur sikhaaey. (Bukhari: 5028)"
"1818","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Usmaan Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein afzal wo hai jo Quran seekhey aur sikhaaey. (Bukhari: 5028)"
"1819","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Quran waley ki misaal bandhay huey oonton waley jaisi hai. Agar wo un par paband rahey to unhey rokta hai. Aur agar wo unhey chhor dey to wo chalay jaatey hain. (Bukhari: 5031)"
"1820","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un mein se kisi key liye bura hai ke wo kahey: Main fulaan fulaan aayat bhool gaya. Balke wo bhulaaya gaya. Aur Quran yaad karo, beshak wo aadmiyon key seenon se oonton se zyada nikal jaaney wala hai. (Bukhari: 5032)"
"1821","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Quran ki nighebaani karo. Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak wo oonton se unki rassiyon mein zyada nikal jaaney wala hai. (Bukhari: 5033)"
"1822","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se poochha gaya: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qiraat kaisi thi? To unhon-ne kaha: Wo lambi thi. Phir unhon-ne padha: (Allah key naam se jo bada Meherbaan Nihayat Rehem wala hai). Wo Allah key naam se lamba kartey aur Rehmaan se lamba kartey aur Raheem se lamba kartey. (Bukhari: 5046)"
"1823","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne us se farmaya: Ae Abu Musa! Beshak tumhey Aale Dawood key mizaaron mein se mizaar diya gaya hai. (Bukhari: 5048)"
"1824","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey waalid ne mera hasab wali aurat se nikaah kar diya. To wo apni bahu ki khabar letey aur us se uskey shohar key baarey mein poochhtey. To wo kehti: Aadmi mein se achha aadmi! Us ne hamaarey liye bistar nahi raunda aur jab se ham uskey paas aaein hain us ne hamaara parda nahi khola. Phir jab wo us par lamba hua to us ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Use mujh se milao! To main us se baad mein mila. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum kaisey roza rakhtey ho? Us ne kaha: Har din. Aap ne farmaya: Aur tum kaisey khatm kartey ho? Us ne kaha: Har raat. Aap ne farmaya: Har mahiney mein teen roza rakkho aur har mahiney mein Quran padho. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main us se zyada ki taaqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Jumuey mein teen din roza rakkho. Main ne kaha: Main us se zyada ki taaqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Do din iftaar karo aur aik din roza rakkho. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main us se zyada ki taaqat rakhta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Afzal rozey, Dawood ka roza rakkho: Aik din roza aur aik din iftaar. Aur har saat raaton mein aik martaba padho. To kaash main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki rukhsat qabool ki hoti. Aur wo isliye ke main budha ho gaya aur kamzor ho gaya. To wo apne ghar walon mein se baaz par din mein Quran ka saatwaan hissa padhta tha. Aur jo wo padhta tha use din mein pesh karta tha taake wo raat ko us par halka ho. Aur jab wo taaqat chaahta to din iftaar karta aur ginta aur un jaisey rozey rakhta. Is khauf se ke wo kuchh chhor dey jis par wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se juda hua tha. (Bukhari: 5052)"
"1825","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum mein qaum niklegi jinki namaz key sath tum apni namaz ko haqeer samjhoge. Aur unkey rozey key sath apne rozey ko. Aur unkey amal key sath apne amal ko. Aur wo Quran parhengey jo unkey halqon se aagey na badhega. Wo deen se nikal jaaengey jaisa teer shikaar se nikal jaata hai. Wo nok mein dekhta hai aur kuchh nahi dekhta. Aur wo lakdi mein dekhta hai aur kuchh nahi dekhta. Aur wo par mein dekhta hai aur kuchh nahi dekhta. Aur wo nok key upar mein shak karta hai. (Bukhari: 5058)"
"1826","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Momin jo Quran padhta hai aur us par amal karta hai, turanj jaisa hai. Uska maza umda hai aur uski khushbu umda hai. Aur momin jo Quran nahi padhta aur us par amal karta hai, khajoor jaisa hai. Uska maza umda hai aur uski khushbu nahi hai. Aur munaafiq ki misaal jo Quran padhta hai, phool jaisi hai jinki khushbu umda hai aur uska maza kadwa hai. Aur munaafiq ki misaal jo Quran nahi padhta, indraayan jaisi hai. Uska maza kadwa ya khabees hai aur uski khushbu kadwi hai. (Bukhari: 5059)"
"1827","[AI-translation] Jundub bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Quran padho jab tak tumhaarey dil milay rahein. Phir jab tum ikhtelaaf karo to us se uth jao. (Bukhari: 5060). Nikaah ki kitaab."
